# Force LF everywhere. This is not cosmetic: the generated SVGs are written by
# Python (LF) both on a Windows workstation and on the Linux runner. With
# core.autocrlf=true the Windows checkout would be CRLF, so regenerating
# locally would show every file as modified and the nightly job would fight
# the working copy forever.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
